  step,dige:857b7f27f55187b6
  step=2,dige:8c658e1450d254fb
    Assertion:two-selves,sentence:two selves stand — each an Identity owning its Peering page — keys ride .c only
  step=3,dige:f05dfb0492b0d481
    Assertion:idzeug-minted,sentence:Alice holds a single-use Idzeug — an unbound Music grant scoped to Classical
  step=4,dige:3aab3d2d108242f9
    Assertion:offline-redeem-fails,sentence:redeeming with the inviter offline fails — the token is proof of receipt not an offline capability
    Assertion:mangled-token-rebuffed,sentence:a mangled token is rebuffed at the redeemer — it never parses and no frame crosses
  step=5,dige:d1deb79f08d1a5af
    Assertion:presig-flip-door,sentence:a flipped presig refuses locally at the door — only the issuer key can wear the MAC — and the true token still seals behind it
    Assertion:friendship-edge,sentence:the friendship is an edge logged in the social graph at both ends
    Assertion:reciprocity-sealed,sentence:each Pier carries a Music grant the OTHER signed — Classical only — reciprocity sealed
    Assertion:page-imported,sentence:Bob imported the page of Alice — the stashed Peering reborn under his Pier
  step=6,dige:dec3447fb00ec61d
    Assertion:single-use-spent,sentence:the Idzeug is single-use — a second redeem finds the nonce spent and is rebuffed
  step=7,dige:88ed1e77ed402e4a
    Assertion:notgrant-retires,sentence:a NotGrant under the Pier retires it at use — the other end stands until told
